{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15102160","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15102160","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1510216001:0":{"text":"野蛮な獣人の雑種が！俺たちは狩りをしに来ただけだ！","source_cn":"野蛮的兽人杂种！我们只是来狩猎野兽！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AC154D89B535619","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510216002:0":{"text":"見てろよ、ペルセウス様が貴様らを――","source_cn":"等着瞧，珀尔修斯统帅会把你们——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3412B2049BFC0B74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:6:1510216003:1":{"text":"ゴーダンの拳が捕虜の鼻をへし折った。","source_cn":"戈丹挥拳砸碎了被俘士兵的鼻子","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D62669FE3A268E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510216004:0":{"text":"ぎゃぁっ……！","source_cn":"唔……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x598B0D640FD7F2A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510216005:0":{"text":"この土地の獣は、我らヤクボルのものだ。","source_cn":"这片领地的野兽属于雅库伯尔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAA08B0912AA544D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1510216006:0":{"text":"貴様らの腹を割き、内